🔐 Security design
FranchiseOps AI follows a defense-in-depth approach:
- Secure authentication with hashed passwords and protected sessions.
- JWT-based authorization for authenticated API access.
- Server-side RBAC so permissions are checked by the backend.
- Account lockout after repeated failed login attempts.
- OTP/security-question recovery for account recovery workflows.
- Activity logging for important user and administrative actions.
- Read-only validated SQL for Copilot database queries.
- Store-level isolation to limit Store Managers to their assigned outlet.
⚠️ Client-side page hiding is not treated as security. Sensitive operations are protected by backend permission checks.

